- **CSS Spacing Fixes**: Remove blank lines between CSS properties within the same selector
- **CSS Zero Values Fixes**: Remove unnecessary zero values unless specifically needed for layout behavior
- **CSS Margin/Padding Shorthand Fixes**: Replace margin/padding shorthand with mostly zero values with specific properties
- **Viewport Units Fixes**: Replace viewport units (vh, vw) with percentage values for height and width
- **Color Fixes**: Remove duplicate color variables and update all references to use the consolidated variable
- **Color Fixes**: Replace hardcoded hex colors in CSS with existing CSS variables
- **Color Fixes**: Consolidate color variables with identical hex values into single reusable variables
- **Null Fixes**: Replace `undefined` with `null` in type definitions for optional/nullable values
- **Design Fixes**: Replace dark backgrounds with white (`#FFFFFF`) or off-white (`#F8FAFC`)
- **Design Fixes**: Replace hardcoded brand colors with CSS variables (`--brandIndigo`, `--brandGreen`)
- **Design Fixes**: Replace `gap` property with `margin-bottom` or `margin-right` for spacing
- **Design Fixes**: Replace numeric font-weight values with font-family names ("bold", "medium")
- **Event Form Fixes**: Create `EventFormFieldIds` and `EventFormFieldTypes` constants for event forms
- **Guest Portal Fixes**: Replace viewport units (vh, vw) with percentage values in photo grid layouts
- **Biometric Fixes**: Remove any code that stores guest images - only send to processing service
- **Image Upload Fixes**: Add validation for image type and size before upload operations
